# Routine "Daily candidate batch": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every weekday morning, sources a small batch of new candidates for the open role, deduped against your pipeline, with evidence and a source link on every card.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/sherlock && pi -p "/daily-candidate-batch"
